    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Geos Product Cleanup Manager for WooCommerce helps you clean large WooCommerce catalogs safely using controlled background ticks. Cleanup operations move products to Trash (non-destructive). Trash Cleaner can permanently delete products already in Trash.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin ZIP and activate it.</li>\n<li>Ensure WooCommerce is active.</li>\n<li>Go to Tools <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Geos Product Cleanup Manager for WooCommerce.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.3.9</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Replaced inline admin  output with proper wp_enqueue_script/wp_localize_script (review request)</li>\n<li>Shortened readme short description to avoid truncation warnings</li>\n<li>Packaged ZIP filename to match the expected WordPress.org submission name</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Batched WooCommerce product cleanup with separate operations, progress bars, and a safe Trash Cleaner.",
